<!-- wp:group {"className":"fr-wrap fr-story-intro","layout":{"type":"default"},"tagName":"section"} --><section class="wp-block-group fr-wrap fr-story-intro"><!-- wp:paragraph {"className":"fr-breadcrumb"} --><p class="fr-breadcrumb"><a class="text-link" href="<?php echo esc_url( home_url( '/' ) ); ?>">Home</a> / Our story</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:heading {"level":1} --><h1 class="wp-block-heading">A family at prayer.<br>A world of possibility.</h1><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph {"className":"fr-lead"} --><p class="fr-lead">Family Rosary helps families discover and grow in shared prayer, inspired by the life and mission of Venerable Patrick Peyton.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></section><!-- /wp:group --><!-- wp:group {"className":"fr-wrap fr-section fr-story-spread","layout":{"type":"default"},"tagName":"section"} --><section class="wp-block-group fr-wrap fr-section fr-story-spread"><!-- wp:image {"className":"fr-story-archive"} --><figure class="wp-block-image fr-story-archive"><img src="<?php echo esc_url( get_theme_file_uri( 'assets/father-peyton.webp' ) ); ?>" alt="Father Peyton addressing a large crowd in an archival photograph."/></figure><!-- /wp:image --><!-- wp:group {"className":"fr-story-text","layout":{"type":"default"}} --><div class="wp-block-group fr-story-text"><!-- wp:heading {"level":2} --><h2 class="wp-block-heading">“The family that prays together stays together.”</h2><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Father Peyton brought a simple invitation to families: make room for prayer together. His work grew into a worldwide mission, bringing people together through the Rosary and the message of family prayer.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>That invitation continues in practical ways: a parent learning to lead a decade, children discovering the mysteries, a parish gathering in prayer, and families supporting one another.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p><a class="text-link" href="https://www.fatherpeyton.org/">Explore Father Peyton’s life</a></p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:group --></section><!-- /wp:group --><!-- wp:group {"className":"fr-wrap fr-section","layout":{"type":"default"},"tagName":"section"} --><section class="wp-block-group fr-wrap fr-section"><!-- wp:heading {"level":2} --><h2 class="wp-block-heading">The mission takes shape in real places.</h2><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:group {"className":"fr-mission-grid","layout":{"type":"default"}} --><div class="wp-block-group fr-mission-grid"><!-- wp:group {"className":"fr-mission-feature","layout":{"type":"default"}} --><div class="wp-block-group fr-mission-feature"><!-- wp:image {"className":""} --><figure class="wp-block-image "><img src="<?php echo esc_url( get_theme_file_uri( 'assets/rosary-service.webp' ) ); ?>" alt="Young people and adults packing Rosaries around a table in the Philippines."/></figure><!-- /wp:image --><!-- wp:heading {"level":3} --><h3 class="wp-block-heading">Sharing the gift of the Rosary</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Rosary packing with youth in Novaliches, Philippines. A glimpse of the hands and communities behind the ministry.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p><a class="text-link" href="https://hcfm.org/global/">Read ministry stories around the world</a></p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:group --><!-- wp:group {"className":"fr-mission-feature","layout":{"type":"default"}} --><div class="wp-block-group fr-mission-feature"><!-- wp:image {"className":""} --><figure class="wp-block-image "><img src="<?php echo esc_url( get_theme_file_uri( 'assets/family-festival.webp' ) ); ?>" alt="Participants walking together at an outdoor Catholic Family Festival."/></figure><!-- /wp:image --><!-- wp:heading {"level":3} --><h3 class="wp-block-heading">Come together in prayer</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Families and community gathered at The Father Peyton Center. Explore current opportunities to visit and pray together.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p><a class="text-link" href="https://www.familyrosary.org/">Find current gatherings</a></p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:group --></div><!-- /wp:group --></section><!-- /wp:group --><!-- wp:group {"className":"fr-wrap fr-section fr-giving","layout":{"type":"default"},"tagName":"section"} --><section class="wp-block-group fr-wrap fr-section fr-giving"><!-- wp:heading {"level":2} --><h2 class="wp-block-heading">Help another family<br>find its way to prayer.</h2><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Your support helps Family Rosary share the gift of prayer with families.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:group {"className":"fr-actions","layout":{"type":"default"}} --><div class="wp-block-group fr-actions"><!-- wp:button {"className":"is-style-outline"} --><div class="wp-block-button is-style-outline"><a class="wp-block-button__link wp-element-button" href="https://www.familyrosary.org/support-family-rosary">Support Family Rosary</a></div><!-- /wp:button --></div><!-- /wp:group --></section><!-- /wp:group -->
